{"seq":1,"slug":"data-science-overview","title":"数据科学概论","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview","rating":{"composite":3.44,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数据科学概论 简介\n\n数据科学是一门融合统计学、计算机科学和领域知识的交叉学科，旨在从数据中提取有价值的洞察和知识。在数据驱动决策日益普及的今天，数据科学已成为企业核心竞争力的重要组成部分，也是技术从业者拓展职业边界的关键能力。\n\n## 定位与目标读者\n\n本知识库为数据科学的入门导论，面向希望系统了解数据科学全貌的程序员和技术人员，帮助他们建立对数据科学领域的整体认知和实践基础。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 至少一种编程语言的基本使用能力（推荐 Python）\n- 高中数学（概率、统计基础概念）\n- 基本的数据库概念（表、查询）\n- 了解软件开发的基本流程\n\n## 内容结构\n\n第1章**数据科学基础**从学科定义出发，介绍数据科学的核心概念、数据思维方法论以及统计学在数据科学中的基础地位。\n\n第2章**数据科学工作流**系统讲解从数据采集到模型部署的完整工作流程，涵盖数据清洗、探索性分析和建模部署三大关键环节。\n\n第3章**数据科学工具**介绍数据科学实践中的核心工具生态，包括Python数据科学生态、SQL的高级应用以及Notebook开发环境的选择与使用。\n\n第4章**数据科学职业**探讨数据科学领域的职业发展路径，涵盖角色定位与技能要求、项目管理方法以及数据伦理与社会责任。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[数据科学基础] --> B[数据科学工作流]\n    B --> C[数据科学工具]\n    C --> D[数据科学职业]\n```\n\n建议读者从第1章开始顺序学习，建立扎实的基础认知后再进入工具和实践层面，最后通过第4章规划自己的数据科学职业路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ds-foundations","title":"数据科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-data-science","title":"什么是数据科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-foundations/what-is-data-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-thinking","title":"数据思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-foundations/data-thinking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistics-for-ds","title":"数据科学中的统计基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-foundations/statistics-for-ds"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ds-workflow","title":"数据科学工作流","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-collection-cleaning","title":"数据采集与清洗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-workflow/data-collection-cleaning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"eda-analysis","title":"探索性数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-workflow/eda-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modeling-deployment","title":"建模与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-workflow/modeling-deployment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ds-tools","title":"数据科学工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"python-ds-ecosystem","title":"Python 数据科学生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-tools/python-ds-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sql-for-ds","title":"SQL 在数据科学中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-tools/sql-for-ds"},{"seq":3,"slug":"notebooks-environments","title":"Notebook 与开发环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-tools/notebooks-environments"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ds-careers","title":"数据科学职业","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-careers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ds-roles-skills","title":"数据科学角色与技能体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-careers/ds-roles-skills"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ds-project-management","title":"数据科学项目管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-careers/ds-project-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ds-ethics-responsibility","title":"数据伦理与责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-science-overview/ds-careers/ds-ethics-responsibility"}]}]}